/**
\fn pdg::Sprite::getAnimationBindingTransform(string name, int space)
\brief Copy an evaluated binding transform.

Evaluates the current pose, including overrides and controllers. Unknown names, unavailable poses, and invalid spaces throw. Returned values are independent of the live Sprite.

\param name Exact binding name returned by getAnimationBindingNames().
\param space Integer coordinate-space constant: \c pdg.animationSpace_Local (parent frame), \c pdg.animationSpace_Rig, or \c pdg.animationSpace_World (owning layer).

\return An object with x, y, rotation, scaleX, scaleY, and alpha; see \ref animation_pose_snapshot.

\note Call enableAnimationPose() successfully before using this method.

\see getAnimationBindingNames(), getAnimationPose()
*/
